      "cooked": "<p>I think I know the answer to this question, but I just want to check to be sure.</p><p>If a hero has the Vitality Conduit in front of them and a villain plays a card that deals them 1 X damage and 1 Y damage, does the Conduit activate once or twice?</p>",
