      "created_at": "2015-01-12T03:58:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The answer is zero, if it's the hero being hit. &nbsp;If it's the Conduit being hit, then it will be twice, assuming the conduit survives both hits. &nbsp;If it breaks, it won't trigger for the damage that broke it (or any damage after that)</p>",
